# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev` (see docs/google-rating.md).
#
# Copy this file to .dev.vars (gitignored, never committed) and fill in a
# real key to test the live Google rating locally. Without it, `wrangler
# dev` still runs fine — the rating API just reports "not configured" and
# the homepage component falls back to a plain Google Maps link, exactly
# as it will in production until these are set there too.

GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
